[{"id":"MjEw-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara unsur berikut yang memiliki ion dengan muatan +2 dengan konfigurasi elektron <img alt=\"1s^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?1s%5E%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"2s^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2s%5E%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"2p^{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2p%5E%7B6%7D\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"3s^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?3s%5E%7B2%7D\" /><img alt=\"3p^{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?3p%5E%7B6%7D\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"3d^{10}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?3d%5E%7B10%7D\" />&nbsp;adalah<br />","choices":["K","Si","Zn","Ca","Ge"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYyMw"},{"id":"MjEw-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Rumus molekul suatu garam adalah <img alt=\"XCl_{2-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?XCl_%7B2-%7D\" />. Ion X dalam garam ini mempunyai 27 elektron, maka logam X adalah<br />","choices":["Ni","Co","Fe","Cu","Zn"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYyNA"},{"id":"MjEw-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Larutan natrium sulfat dapat bereaksi dengan larutan barium klorida sesuai persamaan reaksi yang setara berikut :<br /><br /><img alt=\"Na_{2}O_{4}(aq)+BaCl_{2}(aq)\\rightarrow 2NaCl(aq)+BaSO_{4}(s)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Na_%7B2%7DO_%7B4%7D%28aq%29&amp;plus;BaCl_%7B2%7D%28aq%29%5Crightarrow%202NaCl%28aq%29&amp;plus;BaSO_%7B4%7D%28s%29\" /><br /><br /> Seorang siswa mencampurkan larutan yang mengandung 10,0 g <img alt=\"Na_{2}SO_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Na_%7B2%7DSO_%7B4%7D\" /> dicampurkan dengan larutan yang mengandung 10,0 g <img alt=\"BaCl_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?BaCl_%7B2%7D\" />, dan diperoleh 12,0 g <img alt=\"BaSO_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?BaSO_%7B4%7D\" />. Persen hasil (rendemen) dari reaksi ini adalah<br />","choices":["60,0%","73,1%","82,4 %","93,3%","&gt;100%, karena endapan barium sulfat yang diperoleh masih basah."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYyNQ"},{"id":"MjEw-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara larutan dalam air berikut ini yang mempunyai titik didih paling tinggi adalah<br />","choices":["1,0 m asam asetat, <img alt=\"CH_{3}COOH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_%7B3%7DCOOH\" />","1,0 m asam klorida, <img alt=\"HCl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?HCl\" />","1,0 m asam sulfat, <img alt=\"H_{2}SO_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?H_%7B2%7DSO_%7B4%7D\" />","1,0 m asam fosfat, <img alt=\"H_{3}PO_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?H_%7B3%7DPO_%7B4%7D\" />","1,0 m glukosa, <img alt=\"C_{6}H_{12}O_{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B6%7DH_%7B12%7DO_%7B6%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYyNg"},{"id":"MjEw-q05","number":5,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Kalor pembentukan timbal(II) karbonat adalah 699 kJ/mol. Persamaan reaksi yang paling tepat untuk proses tersebut adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200616144743.jpg\" style=\"height:83px; width:262px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYyNw"},{"id":"MjEw-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara larutan garam dengan konsentrasi 0,1 M berikut yang memberikan nilai pH paling tinggi adalah<br />","choices":["<img alt=\"NaCl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NaCl\" />","<img alt=\"NaNO_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NaNO_%7B3%7D\" />","<img alt=\"NaCIO_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NaCIO_%7B4%7D\" />","<img alt=\"NaHSO_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NaHSO_%7B4%7D\" />","<img alt=\"NaHCO_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NaHCO_%7B3%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYyOA"},{"id":"MjEw-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara larutan dalam air berikut:<br /><br /> i. 0,2 M HF<br /> ii. 1,5 M&nbsp;<img alt=\"CH_{3}COONa\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_%7B3%7DCOONa\" /><br /> iii. 3,0 M&nbsp;<img alt=\"NH_{4}Br\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B4%7DBr\" /><br /> iv. 0,5 M&nbsp;<img alt=\"NH_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B3%7D\" /><br /> v. 0,85 M&nbsp;<img alt=\"FeCl_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?FeCl_%7B3%7D\" /><br /><br /> yang mempunyai pH <strong>dibawah</strong> 7,0 adalah<br />","choices":["i, iii, v","ii, iv","i, ii, iii","hanya i","tidak ada, semua bersifat basa"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYyOQ"},{"id":"MjEw-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Ke dalam larutan HCl 4 M ditambahkan padatan berikut:<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200616145335.jpg\" style=\"height:24px; width:256px\" /><br /><br /> Padatan yang akan menghasilkan gas ketika ditambahkan ke dalam larutan HCl 4 M adalah<br />","choices":["Hanya I","Hanya II","Hanya I dan III","I , II dan III","Tidak ada reaksi yang menghasilkan gas"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYzMA"},{"id":"MjEw-q09","number":9,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Panjang ikatan <img alt=\"\\text{O} - \\text{O}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BO%7D%20-%20%5Ctext%7BO%7D\" /> yang paling pendek terdapat dalam molekul :<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200616145505.jpg\" style=\"height:83px; width:67px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYzMQ"},{"id":"MjEw-q10","number":10,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Berdasarkan teori VSEPR, pasangan molekul/ion yang memiliki geometri segiempat planar adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200616145727.jpg\" style=\"height:92px; width:137px\" /><br /><br /> &nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYzMg"},{"id":"MjEw-q11","number":11,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara pernyataan di bawah ini yang benar adalah<br />","choices":["Energi kisi <img alt=\"MgF_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?MgF_%7B2%7D\" /> lebih kecil dibandingkan <img alt=\"MgCl_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?MgCl_%7B2%7D\" />","Energi kisi <img alt=\"NaCl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NaCl\" /> lebih kecil dibandingkan <img alt=\"KCl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?KCl\" />","Energi kisi <img alt=\"KCl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?KCl\" /> lebih kecil dibandingkan <img alt=\"MgCl_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?MgCl_%7B2%7D\" />","Energi kisi <img alt=\"MgO\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?MgO\" /> lebih kecil dibandingkan <img alt=\"CaS\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CaS\" />","Energi kisi <img alt=\"NaF\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NaF\" /> lebih kecil dibandingkan <img alt=\"NaCl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NaCl\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYzMw"},{"id":"MjEw-q12","number":12,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini diberikan tabel entalpi dissosiasi ikatan (EDI) :<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200616150530.jpg\" style=\"height:57px; width:385px\" /><br /> Nilai entalpi pembentukan, ∆Hof untuk <img alt=\"H_{2}O(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?H_%7B2%7DO%28g%29\" />&nbsp;adalah<br />","choices":["&ndash;934 kJ <img alt=\"mol^{-1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?mol%5E%7B-1%7D\" />","&ndash;858. kJ <img alt=\"mol^{-1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?mol%5E%7B-1%7D\" />","&ndash;510. kJ <img alt=\"mol^{-1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?mol%5E%7B-1%7D\" />","&ndash;429 kJ <img alt=\"mol^{-1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?mol%5E%7B-1%7D\" />","&ndash;255 kJ <img alt=\"mol^{-1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?mol%5E%7B-1%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYzNA"},{"id":"MjEw-q13","number":13,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui energi ikatan:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200616150958.jpg\" style=\"height:37px; width:370px\" /><br /> Perubahan entalpi bagi reaksi berikut adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200616151126.jpg\" style=\"height:24px; width:253px\" />","choices":["31 kJ","62 kJ","93 kJ","124 kJ","146 kJ"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODYzNQ"},{"id":"MjEw-q14","number":14,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan reaksi berikut :<br /><br /><img alt=\"A+B+C \\rightarrow D \\quad \\text { Laju }=k[A][B]^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A&amp;plus;B&amp;plus;C%20%5Crightarrow%20D%20%5Cquad%20%5Ctext%20%7B%20Laju%20%7D%3Dk%5BA%5D%5BB%5D%5E%7B2%7D\" /><br /><br /> Di antara pernyataan berikut yang tidak meningkatkan laju reaksi adalah<br />","choices":["Menaikkan konsentrasi A.","Menaikkan konsentrasi B.","Menaikkan konsentrasi C","Menambah katalis kedalam campuran reaksi.","Temperatur reaksi dinaikkan."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODczMw"},{"id":"MjEw-q15","number":15,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diberikan data deret aktivitas berikut ini:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200617000544.jpg\" style=\"height:84px; width:198px\" /><br /> Ion yang dapat direduksi oleh logam Zn adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200617000608.jpg\" style=\"height:75px; width:98px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODczNA"},{"id":"MjEw-q16","number":16,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Proses hidrometalurgi untuk pemurnian emas melibatkan pembentukan selektif senyawa kompleks emas yang larut dalam air. Spesi yang direduksi dan dioksidasi dalam reaksi berikut adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"4 \\mathrm{Au}(\\mathrm{s})+\\mathrm{CN}^{-}(\\mathrm{aq})+\\mathrm{O}_{2}(\\mathrm{g})+2 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}(\\mathrm{I}) \\rightarrow 4 \\mathrm{Au}(\\mathrm{CN})_{2}^{-}(\\mathrm{aq})+4 \\mathrm{OH}^{-}(\\mathrm{aq})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?4%20%5Cmathrm%7BAu%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bs%7D%29&amp;plus;%5Cmathrm%7BCN%7D%5E%7B-%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Baq%7D%29&amp;plus;%5Cmathrm%7BO%7D_%7B2%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bg%7D%29&amp;plus;2%20%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BO%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7BI%7D%29%20%5Crightarrow%204%20%5Cmathrm%7BAu%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7BCN%7D%29_%7B2%7D%5E%7B-%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Baq%7D%29&amp;plus;4%20%5Cmathrm%7BOH%7D%5E%7B-%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Baq%7D%29\" /><br />","choices":["<img alt=\"\\mathrm{CN}^{-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BCN%7D%5E%7B-%7D\" /> mengalami oksidasi dan <img alt=\"\\mathrm{Au}(\\mathrm{s})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BAu%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bs%7D%29\" /> mengalami reduksi","<img alt=\"\\mathrm{Au}(\\mathrm{s})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BAu%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bs%7D%29\" /> mengalami oksidasi dan <img alt=\"\\mathrm{CN}^{-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BCN%7D%5E%7B-%7D\" /> mengalami reduksi","<img alt=\"\\text {O}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BO%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> mengalami oksidasi dan <img alt=\"\\mathrm{Au}(\\mathrm{s})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BAu%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bs%7D%29\" /> mengalami reduksi","Au(s) mengalami oksidasi dan <img alt=\"\\text {O}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BO%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> mengalami reduksi","Reaksi ini bukan reaksi reduksi-oksidasi"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODczNQ"},{"id":"MjEw-q17","number":17,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan reaksi kesetimbangan berikut :<br /><br /><img alt=\"2 \\mathrm{NOBr}(\\mathrm{g}) \\leftrightarrows 2 \\mathrm{NO}(\\mathrm{g})+\\mathrm{Br}_{2}(\\mathrm{g}) \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{eq}}=0,064\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%20%5Cmathrm%7BNOBr%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bg%7D%29%20%5Cleftrightarrows%202%20%5Cmathrm%7BNO%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bg%7D%29&amp;plus;%5Cmathrm%7BBr%7D_%7B2%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bg%7D%29%20%5Cmathrm%7BK%7D_%7B%5Cmathrm%7Beq%7D%7D%3D0%2C064\" /><br /><br /> Pada kesetimbangan, wadah tertutup yang volumenya 1,00 L mengandung 0,030 mol NOBr dan 0,030 mol NO. Jumlah mol <img alt=\"\\mathrm{Br}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BBr%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> dalam wadah tersebut adalah<br />","choices":["0,0019","0,030","0,064","0,470","0,090"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODczNg"},{"id":"MjEw-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Asam lemah HA mempunyai nilai tetapan disosiasi <img alt=\"K_{a}=1,0 \\times 10^{-7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K_%7Ba%7D%3D1%2C0%20%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-7%7D\" /> . Di antara pernyataan berikut yang benar untuk larutan 0,30 M HA dalam air adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200617001146.jpg\" style=\"height:55px; width:116px\" />","choices":["Hanya i","Hanya ii","Hanya i dan ii","Hanya ii dan iii","Semua betul, i, ii, dan iii"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODczNw"},{"id":"MjEw-q19","number":19,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui nilai&nbsp;<img alt=\"K_{\\mathrm{b}} \\text{ }\\mathrm{NH}_{3}=1,8 \\times 10^{-5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K_%7B%5Cmathrm%7Bb%7D%7D%20%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B3%7D%3D1%2C8%20%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-5%7D\" />&nbsp;dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"K_{a}\\text{ } H C_{2} H_{3} O_{2}=1,8 \\times 10^{-5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K_%7Ba%7D%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%20H%20C_%7B2%7D%20H_%7B3%7D%20O_%7B2%7D%3D1%2C8%20%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-5%7D\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;Nilai pH dari larutan amonium asetat,&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\mathrm{NH}_{4} \\mathrm{C}_{2} \\mathrm{H}_{3} \\mathrm{O}_{2} \\quad 0,065 \\text{ }\\mathrm{M}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B4%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BC%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B3%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BO%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Cquad%200%2C065%20%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%5Cmathrm%7BM%7D\" />&nbsp;adalah<br />","choices":["1,19","2,96","7,00","11,06","12,81"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODc5OA"},{"id":"MjEw-q20","number":20,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Semua senyawa berikut adalah isomer dari siklopentanon, <em>kecuali</em><br />","choices":["2-metil siklobutanon","2-etil sikopropanon","2,3-dimetil siklopropena","Metil-siklobutil-eter","1-pentena-3-on"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODc5OQ"},{"id":"MjEw-q21","number":21,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Konformasi Newman yang benar untuk senyawa di bawah ini adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622073613.jpg\" style=\"height:96px; width:93px\" />","choices":["Gauche-2-metil pentana","Gauche-3-metil pentana","Eclips-4-metil heksana","Trans-2-metil heksana","Trans-3-metil heksana"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODgwMA"},{"id":"MjEw-q22","number":22,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Untuk mendapatkan senyawa jenuh, yaitu senyawa yang tidak memiliki ikatan rangkap, dapat dilakukan reaksi-reaksi berikut, kecuali<br />","choices":["Hidrogenasi sikloheksena dengan katalis logam","Reduksi aseton dengan hidrida logam","Reaksi alkohol dalam larutan asam sulfat pekat","Adisi asam halida pada propena","Pembuatan polietilena"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODgwMQ"},{"id":"MjEw-q23","number":23,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara reaksi-reaksi di bawah ini yang tidak dapat digunakan untuk membuat&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\mathrm{CH}_{3} \\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\mathrm{Cl}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BCH%7D_%7B3%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BCH%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BCl%7D\" />&nbsp;adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622073726.jpg\" style=\"height:75px; width:139px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODgwMg"},{"id":"MjEw-q24","number":24,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi substitusi nukleofilik dengan nukleofil ion metoksida (<img alt=\"\\text{CH}_{3}\\text{O}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BCH%7D_%7B3%7D%5Ctext%7BO%7D\" />) dapat berlangsung pada senyawa-senyawa berikut, kecuali&nbsp;<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622073857.jpg\" style=\"height:239px; width:143px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODgwMw"},{"id":"MjEw-q25","number":25,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jenis reaksi yang paling tepat untuk reaksi di bawah ini adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622074003.jpg\" style=\"height:21px; width:196px\" /><br />","choices":["Adisi elektrofilik","Substitusi elektrofilik aromatik","Substitusi radikal bebas","Adisi nukleofilik","Substitusi nukleofilik"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODgwNA"},{"id":"MjEw-q26","number":26,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jika bromoetana direaksikan dengan kalium sianida, dan kemudian hasil reaksinya direduksi, maka produk senyawanya adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622074041.jpg\" style=\"height:74px; width:137px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODgwNQ"},{"id":"MjEw-q27","number":27,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Kutu mengeluarkan bebauan untuk menarik sesama jenisnya. Senyawa ini dikenal dengan nama lardolure dan dapat dihidrolisis dengan asam. Struktur dari larddolure adalah sebagai berikut:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622074125.jpg\" style=\"height:90px; width:303px\" /><br /> Senyawa lardolure ini disederhanakan menjadi:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622074154.jpg\" style=\"height:66px; width:142px\" /><br /> Produk yang terjadi apabila lardolure dihidrolisis dengan asam adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622074227.jpg\" style=\"height:87px; width:173px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODgwNg"},{"id":"MjEw-q28","number":28,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Produk yang dihasilkan jika 4-metil-2-heksena direaksikan dengan <img alt=\"\\text {Cl}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7BCl%7D_%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp;dengan adanya sinar UV adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622074318.jpg\" style=\"height:83px; width:239px\" />","choices":["5-kloro-3-metil-1-heksena","4-kloro-3-metil-2-heksena","5-kloro-4-metil-2-heksena","2,3-dikloro-4-metil-2-heksena","4-kloro-4-metil-2-heksena"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODgwNw"},{"id":"MjEw-q29","number":29,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jika senyawa 3-metil-2-pentena direaksikan dengan pereaksi halohidrin (<img alt=\"\\text{Br}_{2},\\text{H}_{2}\\text{O}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BBr%7D_%7B2%7D%2C%5Ctext%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%7BO%7D\" />):<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622074444.jpg\" style=\"height:86px; width:233px\" /><br /> produknya selalu menghasilkan senyawa anti (trans). Produk yang paling tepat untuk reaksi di atas adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622074517.jpg\" style=\"height:280px; width:420px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODgwOA"},{"id":"MjEw-q30","number":30,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara senyawa berikut ini yang kelarutannya paling besar di dalam air adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200622075035.jpg\" style=\"height:82px; width:167px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODgwOQ"}]
